            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Lisa"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Absolutely FABULOUS. After making this, I don't think I can ever eat store bouught again. I didn't have some items so I substituted. I used rice wine vinegar, red onion, garlic aoili mustard and dark brown sugar. I think the buttermilk and mustard really makes this recipe special."
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "5"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "anne13"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This coleslaw is amazing. The dressing is tangy and has a bit of a pop from the dijon. Many of the commentators didn't use buttermilk, I think the buttermilk is definitely great in this. The only change I made was to make my own cole slaw mix from fresh veggies - 1/2 a very small red cabbage, 1/2 a medium green cabbage, and 2 good sized carrots. I used an 1/8\" slice on the mandolin for the cabbage and the julienne setting for the carrots. My husband took a taste before dinner and asked me why we ever buy cole slaw from the store. We won't anymore.",
            "datePublished": "2012-05-06T10:39:55.633Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "5"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Jillian"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Pretty darn delicious! Made it per instructions with the exception of buttermilk. I Figured it had enough vinegar and making some for three tablespoons wouldn’t be worth it. I used heavy cream instead. Much more tastier than my recipe! Oh, and I added raisins. You have to let them plump back up though.",
            "datePublished": "2020-07-10T19:22:45.407Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "5"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Doug Gilpin"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Made it on the fly with a half head of cabbage, shredded a carrot, and used 6 scallions for the onion. Other than the ‘Cole’, what’s the significance of coupling this with the famous composer/songwriter? Great salad with roasted potato quarters and pork tenderloin with a dry rub.",
            "datePublished": "2023-06-21T11:23:06.606Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "5"
