            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Mary Ralian"
            },
            "reviewBody": "well it will be a crowd pleaser, I checked off all the other helper comments - and I didn't have buttermilk but it was still wonderful and I was surprised that it didn't call for or need celery seed, so I left it out - we did have fresh parsley and 14 oz bag so I was short on each of the ingredients a tad one purpose. (instead of what was called for: a 16 oz bag of cole slaw mixture).",
            "datePublished": "2024-10-26T17:04:29.755Z"
          },
