            },
            "reviewBody": "This is good! I used it as a base. I didn't have buttermilk so I used 3 tbsp light sour cream and about a teaspoon of Half n Half. I left out the onion but added about a half teaspoon of celery seed, something I remember my mom doing. Tea",
